+    // The chunk graph is built ONCE and reused for every decode step, the way llama.cpp reuses a graph
+    // across tokens of a recurrent/streaming model: allocate once, then write new data into the same input
+    // tensors and compute again. Rebuilding it per step cost 0.196 s + 0.349 s of alloc per 69 s clip, and
+    // the previous code had a latent use-after-free doing it - build_chunk_graph returned a graph whose
